  "details": "Attempting to use the free mouse \"tab\" button will result in the mouse always locked at the middle of the screen rendering it functionally useless until you leave the 3rd person view or you open your quick menu.\n\n1. Enter 3rd person view by either pressing F5 or free your mouse and press the button on the right (if you have the button enabled).\n\n2. Attempt to continue using the mouse while holding tab.\n\nEdit: I realize this is probably intended behavior in *some capacity* however the game does not make this clear. (I personally almost never use the feature)\n\nThe game should probably instead accept a tap to switch between allowing rotating the camera and holding to free the camera or make the controls a bit more clear in this regard.",
